2.
Definitions.
(1)
In these rules unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the "Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act, 2009" (Central Act No. 27 of 2009) ;
(b)
"Department" means the "Animal/Sheep Husbandry and Fisheries Department" of State of Jammu and Kashmir ;
(c)
"Director" means the person notified as Director under clause (g) of section 2 of the Act ;
(d)
"Form" means a form appended to these rules ;
(e)
"Section" means a section of the act ;
(f)
"Identification" means identifying the animals by way of ear tagging, tattooing, marking, photographs, microchips etc. or
any other suitable system ;
(2)
Words and expressions used in these rules and not defined herein shall have the same meaning as assigned to them in
the Central Act.
